we're learning more about the alleged  activities of a leader of a militia  group that's been detaining migrants  near the us-mexico border 69 year-old  Larry Mitchell Hopkins head of the  United constitutional Patriots is  charged with being a felon in possession  of a firearm now he could face up to 10  years in prison if convicted videos from  the group apparently show militia  members stopping migrants sometimes at  gunpoint near the border in New Mexico  Mireya Villarreal shows us how that is  angered state leaders the united  constitutional Patriots say they are  simply doing their part to enforce u.s.  immigration laws in 60 days they claim  they've captured roughly 5600 migrants  who illegally enter the country to human  rights activists they're a group of  gun-toting vigilantes these are the  kinds of videos you're accustomed to  seeing of you know terrorist groups out  in the deserts of Afghanistan Peter  Simonson executive director of the ACLU  of New Mexico worries migrants are being  subjected to violence and abuse not seen  on video it just makes your heart sink  to see human beings and particularly  children exposed to this kind of a  threat New Mexico's governor and  Attorney General denounced the militia  last week while the Border Patrol warned  them about interference by civilians in  law enforcement matters somebody called  Border Patrol Simonson claims militia  members who often carry badges and dress  in camouflage are breaking laws against  kidnapping and impersonating federal  agents but only one has actually been  arrested 69 year old commander Larry  Hopkins who also uses the alias Johnny  Horton Jr this country was built on  three things  God Hopkins appeared before a federal  judge Monday charged with possessing a  firearm as a felon according to  prosecutors he has three felony  convictions in Michigan and Oregon  including impersonating a peace officer  and that nine guns were seized from his  home back in 2017 Hopkins attorney Kelly  O'Connell says his client is not guilty  of the gun charge which is unrelated to  the malicious activities when he got  arrested  it made it seem like it was something  that was going on down here according to  the accusations it happened up north the  FBI said Hopkins also told them the  militia was training to assassinate  Barack Obama Hillary Clinton and  Democratic donor George Soros on Monday  militia members were dealt another blow  when the owner of the land were they set  up their camp kicked them out they have  to leave by the end of the week for CBS  this morning midday AVL
 

